## Audit method

I compared the generated workbook with the Stage 2 technical specification, inspected the defined names and representative formulas, tested the eleven-row settlement-spot grid, and reviewed every worksheet visually. I also confirmed that the workbook’s **Audit Summary** tab mirrors these findings and draws its status values from the live Checks tab.

